  SMB_POSTURE
  IDENTITY_GRAPH
  ATTACK_PATH_ANALYSIS
  // Prompt 17 §12: mobile assessment profiles. The legacy MOBILE
  // profile above remains as the alias for MOBILE_STATIC_BASELINE.
