  // MOBILE_STATIC_ANALYSIS and MOBILE_BINARY_ANALYSIS are tool stages
  // on MOBILE_STATIC_ANALYSIS workers only; MOBILE_DYNAMIC_SESSION and
  // MOBILE_TRAFFIC_ANALYSIS run only on MOBILE_DYNAMIC_ANALYSIS
  // workers with an approved lab session (§53–§74).
